    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 2D online shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently you can play in solo and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Solo Mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314090/extras/770fb0e0aeb534a133f7499b2ab1ca9a.avif?t=1739522515\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, you can play from stages 1 to 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Multimode</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314090/extras/5fa84f5ea0aead2435d94210895abc28.avif?t=1739522515\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four people can play against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win if you survive three rounds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 2D online shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently you can play in solo and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Solo Mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314090/extras/770fb0e0aeb534a133f7499b2ab1ca9a.avif?t=1739522515\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, you can play from stages 1 to 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Multimode</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314090/extras/5fa84f5ea0aead2435d94210895abc28.avif?t=1739522515\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four people can play against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win if you survive three rounds.</p>",
